SUMMARY:PIANO KARAOKE w/Jordan Chez
DESCRIPTION:MAKE A REQUEST\nCheck out Jordan’s SONG LIST\nTIP YOUR PIANIST!! Venmo: @Jordan-Chesebrough \nJordan Chez is a singer\, songwriter\, and pianist raised on the Jersey Shore\, where he spent his summers gigging at its storied seaside bars and clubs. After graduating from the Frost School of Music at University of Miami\, he moved inland to Nashville in late 2024 and released his debut EP “Chez Chez” (Pronounced shay chezz) in August 2025. When he’s not playing his own stuff\, Jordan loves nothing more than a room full of people ready to sing\, so don’t be shy with the requests!
URL:https://sidgolds.com/event/piano-karaoke-w-jordan-chez-3/2026-05-30/
LOCATION:Sid Gold’s Request Room Nashville\, 3245 Gallatin Pike\, Nashville\, TN\, 37216\, United States
CATEGORIES:Nashville Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://sidgolds.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Jordan-Chez-2026.jpeg
END:VEVENT
