DESCRIPTION:How it works:\nPlease tip Adam!\nCheck out Adam’s song list!\nMake a request!\n\nD.C. transplant\, born and bred in good ol’ Kansas City\, Kansas! Loves jazz\, sushi\, and dogs/cats of all kinds. Can rap pretty darn fast. Send up a request!
